WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:14.103
"Your hair is too long," Mom said to the boys.

2
00:00:14.104 --> 00:00:19.013
"But I can't take you for a haircut today."

3
00:00:19.014 --> 00:00:22.707
"No problem," Aunt Judy said.

4
00:00:22.708 --> 00:00:27.249
"I'll take them to the hair salon."

5
00:00:27.250 --> 00:00:31.499
"I want a buzz cut!" Harry said.

6
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:37.046
"Me too," Oliver said.

7
00:00:37.047 --> 00:00:41.455
At the salon Oliver sat in a big chair.

8
00:00:41.456 --> 00:00:46.749
The stylist made it go up and up.

9
00:00:46.750 --> 00:00:50.438
"Now I can reach you," she said.

10
00:00:50.439 --> 00:00:54.188
The stylist turned on her hair clipper.

11
00:00:54.189 --> 00:00:57.027
Buzz. Buzz.

12
00:00:57.028 --> 00:00:59.315
Oliver frowned.

13
00:00:59.316 --> 00:01:03.925
"What if I don't like my haircut?"

14
00:01:03.926 --> 00:01:09.439
"Don't worry. It'll grow back," Aunt Judy said.

15
00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:13.323
The stylist finished Oliver's haircut.

16
00:01:13.324 --> 00:01:16.700
Then she started cutting Harry's hair.

17
00:01:16.701 --> 00:01:21.249
Buzz. Buzz.

18
00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:25.565
"What if I look weird with a buzz cut?" he asked.

19
00:01:25.566 --> 00:01:30.303
"Don't worry. It'll grow out," Aunt Judy said.

20
00:01:30.304 --> 00:01:34.656
"Hmm. I think I'll get a haircut too."

21
00:01:34.657 --> 00:01:38.959
Another stylist washed Aunt Judy's hair.

22
00:01:38.960 --> 00:01:43.598
Then Aunt Judy sat in a chair next to Harry.

23
00:01:43.599 --> 00:01:47.835
The stylist picked up his scissors and comb.

24
00:01:47.836 --> 00:01:52.940
"I just want a trim," Aunt Judy said.

25
00:01:52.941 --> 00:01:56.801
After their haircuts the boys were happy.

26
00:01:56.802 --> 00:02:00.691
"I like my buzz cut!" Harry said.

27
00:02:00.692 --> 00:02:05.180
"Me too!" Oliver said.

28
00:02:05.181 --> 00:02:07.908
Aunt Judy made a face.

29
00:02:07.909 --> 00:02:13.417
"My hair is too short," she said.

30
00:02:13.418 --> 00:02:17.768
"Don't worry," the boys said together.

31
00:02:17.769 --> 00:02:26.243
"It'll grow back!"

